  "StockRole": "Striker",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Nixe is the Society's test of just how much gun a ProtoMech can carry. It's a quad OmniProto with a minimal engine and decent armor, built around a main gun mount sized for weapons nobody expected on a ProtoMech, like heavy lasers. The pods let it switch between direct fire, long-range support, anti-vehicle, missile and electronic warfare roles. The trade-off is speed, which keeps it in prepared positions instead of the front line.",
